  "whatThisIs": [
    "This authority finishes the remaining ORIGINAL Batch-02 primary selection",
    "slots - indices 8 and 9 - under the landed orgunit-fetch-policy-v3",
    "acquisition behaviour (ADR 0013, Option C-lite). It is NOT Batch 03, NOT a",
    "new batch, NOT reserve acquisition, NOT replacement and NOT classifier work.",
    "",
    "It does not rewrite any historical stop. The historical Batch-02 P5 stop and",
    "the V2 continuation's own P5 stop both stand exactly as recorded. What",
    "changed since those stops is the ACQUISITION OF RECORD for selection indices",
    "5 and 7, which the separately approved Option-B and Option-C-lite evidence",
    "adjudications moved from zero-yield runs to successful targeted",
    "revalidation runs. That is why the carried-forward low-raw-yield count",
    "entering this continuation is 1 and not 3."
  ],

