      "howCarriedForwardStateIsRepresented": [
        "The landed gate ranges over the authorised Batch-02 index set [5,6,7,8,9],",
        "which contains this continuation's scope exactly. The carried-forward",
        "count of 1 is therefore representable with no code change: the operator",
